---
import {
  claimState,
  h140Metrics,
  h142Metrics,
  nextDecisionNodes,
  openEvoProgramLinks,
  openEvoProgramSource,
  programResultLabels,
  programStageLabels,
  programTimeline,
  type ProgramLocale,
} from '../../data/openEvoWebShopProgram';

interface Props { locale?: ProgramLocale }
const { locale = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (zh: string, en: string) => isZh ? zh : en;
const f = new Intl.NumberFormat(locale === 'zh' ? 'zh-CN' : 'en-US', { maximumFractionDigits: 6 });
const hasHistoricalAppendix = Astro.slots.has('historical');
---

<article class="paper-report" data-program-report data-ui-audit="contrast layout overflow" data-testid="openevo-webshop-program-report">
  <header class="paper-header" id="abstract">
    <p class="kicker">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · H1.40 → H1.41 → H1.42-MV · {openEvoProgramSource.checkedAt}</p>
    <h2>{t('从稳定性门到机制诊断', 'From stability gates to mechanism diagnosis')}</h2>
    <p class="abstract"><strong>{t(
      'H1.40 的 E2 经验供给和 G2 结构创建都成立，但 acquisition、retention 与 preservation upstream gates 均未通过。',
      'H1.40 established E2 experience supply and G2 construction, but its acquisition, retention, and preservation upstream gates all failed.'
    )}</strong> {t(
      '256 次 E2 harvest 尝试产生 132 个合格正例、33 个 qualifying identities；G2 最终有 16 个 components、effective rank 64。由于 upstream gates 未通过，预留的 fresh-task T2 面板没有运行。',
      'The 256-attempt E2 harvest produced 132 qualified positives across 33 qualifying identities; G2 ended with 16 components and effective rank 64. Because the upstream gates did not pass, the reserved fresh-task T2 panel did not run.'
    )}</p>
    <p class="implication">{t(
      '研究含义：瓶颈从“能否生成新经验”转向“连续参数写入能否同时保留旧能力并内化新经验”；H1.42 校准后，measurement validity 仍是解释 updater effect 的前置边界。',
      'Research implication: the bottleneck shifted from generating new experience to integrating it into parameters without losing old capability; after H1.42 calibration, measurement validity remains a prerequisite for interpreting updater effects.'
    )}</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('报告目录', 'Report contents')}>
    <a href="#results">{t('结果', 'Results')}</a>
    <a href="#interpretation">{t('解释', 'Interpretation')}</a>
    <a href="#mechanism">{t('机制诊断', 'Mechanism diagnosis')}</a>
    <a href="#next-experiment">{t('下一实验', 'Next experiment')}</a>
    <a href="#methods">{t('方法与来源', 'Methods & sources')}</a>
    <a href="#appendix">{t('附录', 'Appendix')}</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="paper-section" id="results" aria-labelledby="results-title">
    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2 id="results-title">{t('主要结果', 'Primary result')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t(
      '表格把 H1.40 的三层证据和 H1.42 的测量校准分开。T2 没有被误写成失败结果，因为它根本没有打开。',
      'The table separates H1.40 supply/construction/evaluation evidence from H1.42 measurement calibration. T2 is not described as a failed result because it never opened.'
    )}</p>

    <div class="table-region" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t('H1.40 主结果表，可横向滚动', 'H1.40 primary result table, horizontally scrollable')}>
      <table>
        <caption>{t('H1.40 冻结结果：供给、结构与 upstream gates', 'H1.40 frozen result: supply, structure, and upstream gates')}</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('证据层', 'Evidence layer')}</th><th scope="col">{t('观测', 'Observation')}</th><th scope="col">{t('结果', 'Status')}</th><th scope="col">{t('结论边界', 'Claim boundary')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">E2 harvest</th><td>{h140Metrics.e2Harvest.attempts} attempts; {h140Metrics.e2Harvest.qualified} qualified positives; {h140Metrics.e2Harvest.identities} identities</td><td>{t('PASS', 'PASS')}</td><td>{t('供给充足，不等于参数已稳定内化。', 'Supply was sufficient; this is not stable parameter integration.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">G2 construction</th><td>{h140Metrics.g2.components} components; effective rank {h140Metrics.g2.effectiveRank}</td><td>{t('创建成功', 'Created')}</td><td>{t('结构 artifact 存在，不等于行为 acquisition。', 'The structural artifact exists; this is not behavioral acquisition.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Acquisition</th><td>{h140Metrics.acquisition.valid}/{h140Metrics.acquisition.attempts} valid; 4 parser-invalid</td><td>{t('FAIL', 'FAIL')}</td><td>{t('完整 acquisition gate 未成立。', 'The complete acquisition gate did not pass.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">E1 retention</th><td>Δ {f.format(h140Metrics.retention.delta)}; 95% CI [{f.format(h140Metrics.retention.ci[0])}, {f.format(h140Metrics.retention.ci[1])}]</td><td>{t('FAIL', 'FAIL')}</td><td>{t('旧能力保留低于预期门。', 'Old-capability retention missed its gate.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">H1.39 preservation</th><td>Δ {f.format(h140Metrics.preservation.delta)}; 95% CI [{f.format(h140Metrics.preservation.ci[0])}, {f.format(h140Metrics.preservation.ci[1])}]</td><td>{t('FAIL', 'FAIL')}</td><td>{t('CI 下界穿过 −0.05 margin。', 'The CI lower bound crossed the −0.05 margin.')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">H1.42-MV Stage B</th><td>{h142Metrics.stageB.cells}/{h142Metrics.stageB.cells} cells; {h142Metrics.stageB.attempts}/{h142Metrics.stageB.attempts} attempts; 2 C1 invalid clusters</td><td>{t('MVD0', 'MVD0')}</td><td>{t('测量链仍未达到机制解释门；T2 关闭。', 'The measurement chain did not clear the mechanism-interpretation boundary; T2 closed.')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="validity-note"><strong>{t('T2 未打开。', 'T2 remained unopened.')}</strong> {t(
      'acquisition 的 4/4 invalid cell 是 parser-only measurement failure；其余有效尝试仍不足以通过完整结构 gate。不能把这类无效测量自动当成模型无能，也不能把未运行的 T2 写成失败。',
      'The 4/4 invalid acquisition cell was a parser-only measurement failure; the remaining valid attempts still did not establish the complete structural gate. Invalid measurement is not automatically model incompetence, and an unrun T2 is not a failed result.'
    )}</p>

    <aside class="validity-note" aria-label={t('H1.41 机制筛选结果', 'H1.41 mechanism-screen result')}>
      <strong>{t('H1.41：MEASUREMENT_INVALID。', 'H1.41: MEASUREMENT_INVALID.')}</strong> {t(
        'C0 exact H1.40 updater 与 C1 reset-magnitude 完成 96 cells / 384 formal attempts。C0 acquisition point estimate 为 0；两臂 retention 都是 −0.065625；C1 在 acquisition 与 preservation 各有一个无效 cluster。因此这不是 improvement 或 null 的强结论，也不打开任何 T2。',
        'C0 exact H1.40 and C1 reset-magnitude completed 96 cells / 384 formal attempts. C0 acquisition was 0-point; both arms had retention −0.065625; C1 had one invalid cluster in acquisition and one in preservation. This is neither a strong improvement nor null claim, and no T2 opens.'
      )} <a href={openEvoProgramLinks.h141Reconciliation}>{t('查看 reconciliation', 'Read the reconciliation')}</a>
    </aside>

    <aside class="validity-note" aria-label={t('H1.42 测量校准结果', 'H1.42 measurement calibration result')}>
      <strong>{t('H1.42-MV：MVD0 REMEASUREMENT_INVALID。', 'H1.42-MV: MVD0 REMEASUREMENT_INVALID.')}</strong> {t(
        'Stage A 的 192 cells / 768 attempts 通过 MV4 后，Stage B 完成 144 cells / 576 attempts。修正 validator 把 treatment arm 和 sd-lora loader 混淆的问题后，C1 的 acquisition task webshop_003560 与 preservation task webshop_004357 仍为 parser/runtime-invalid；因此不能把 C0/C1 差异解释成 magnitude 机制结果。',
        'After Stage A passed MV4 with 192 cells / 768 attempts, Stage B completed 144 cells / 576 attempts. Once the validator bug conflating the treatment arm with the sd-lora loader was fixed, C1 still had parser/runtime-invalid tasks webshop_003560 in acquisition and webshop_004357 in preservation; C0/C1 differences therefore cannot be interpreted as a magnitude mechanism result.'
      )} <a href={openEvoProgramLinks.h142Closeout}>{t('查看 H1.42 closeout', 'Read the H1.42 closeout')}</a>
    </aside>

    <div class="causal-flow" aria-label={t('H1.40 研究流程与停止位置', 'H1.40 research flow and stopping point')}>
      <div class="flow-node flow-valid"><span>G0 → G1</span><strong>{t('第一代 fresh transfer', 'first-generation fresh transfer')}</strong><small>✓</small></div>
       <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flow-node flow-valid"><span>E2 supply</span><strong>{t('新经验供给', 'new experience supply')}</strong><small>✓</small></div>
       <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flow-node flow-valid"><span>G2</span><strong>{t('16 components created', '16 components created')}</strong><small>✓</small></div>
       <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flow-branch"><div class="flow-node flow-fail"><span>Acquisition</span><strong>{t('新知识写入', 'new knowledge writing')}</strong><small>✕</small></div><div class="flow-node flow-fail"><span>Retention / preservation</span><strong>{t('旧能力稳定性', 'old-capability stability')}</strong><small>✕</small></div></div>
       <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="flow-node flow-stop"><span>T2</span><strong>{t('未打开', 'not opened')}</strong><small>—</small></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="interpretation" aria-labelledby="interpretation-title">
    <p class="section-number">02</p><h2 id="interpretation-title">{t('证据解释', 'Evidence-backed interpretation')}</h2>
    <dl class="interpretation-list">
      <div><dt>{t('支持', 'Supported')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.confirmed[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('不支持', 'Not supported')}</dt><dd><ul><li>{t('H1.40 不支持 G2 fresh-task transfer 或 multi-generation self-evolution，因为 T2 未运行。', 'H1.40 does not support G2 fresh-task transfer or multi-generation self-evolution because T2 did not run.')}</li><li>{t('不能把 magnitude imbalance 写成已证实原因。', 'Magnitude imbalance cannot be stated as a confirmed cause.')}</li><li>{t('该结果不证明 OpenEvo 或所有 continual updater 都无效。', 'The result does not establish that OpenEvo or every continual updater is ineffective.')}</li></ul></dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('仍未知', 'Still unknown')}</dt><dd><ul>{claimState.unknown[locale].map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="mechanism" aria-labelledby="mechanism-title">
    <p class="section-number">03</p><h2 id="mechanism-title">{t('机制诊断', 'Mechanism diagnosis')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('H1.40-MD 是对已有 artifact 的 CPU-only 尸检；H1.42-MV 又对测量链做了同任务、同 seed 的校准。两者都不是 fresh-task transfer，也没有打开 T2。', 'H1.40-MD is a CPU-only autopsy of existing artifacts; H1.42-MV then calibrated the measurement chain on the same tasks and seeds. Neither is fresh-task transfer, and neither opens T2.')}</p>
    <div class="mechanism-grid"><div><strong>Observed</strong><p>{t('H1.40 old/new coefficient means 约为 0.691 / 0.181；H1.42 修正 validator 后，C1 acquisition 与 preservation 各有一个 parser/runtime-invalid cluster。', 'H1.40 old/new coefficient means were about 0.691 / 0.181; after the H1.42 validator fix, C1 still had one parser/runtime-invalid cluster in acquisition and one in preservation.')}</p></div><div><strong>Interpretation</strong><p>{t('magnitude imbalance 仍是候选机制，但 H1.42 MVD0 不允许把 C0/C1 差异当成机制证据。', 'Magnitude imbalance remains a candidate mechanism, but H1.42 MVD0 does not allow C0/C1 differences to be treated as mechanism evidence.')}</p></div><div><strong>Next boundary</strong><p>{t('先修复并重新预注册 measurement chain；只有完整有效的 acquisition、retention、preservation 才能解释 updater effect。', 'Repair and preregister the measurement chain first; only complete valid acquisition, retention, and preservation can support an updater-effect interpretation.')}</p></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section" id="next-experiment" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <p class="section-number">04</p><h2 id="next-title">{t('下一实验', 'Next experiment')}</h2>
    <p class="recommendation-label">{t('建议 / 设计移交，不是实验结果', 'Recommendation / design handoff, not an experimental result')}</p>
    <p class="section-intro">{t(
      'H1.42 已完成测量校准，但修正 validator 后仍选择 MVD0：不要追加 seeds/tasks/retries，也不要把 C1 写成 improvement；下一轮若继续，必须先为 measurement repair 另行冻结 preregistration。',
      'H1.42 completed measurement calibration, but the corrected selector remains MVD0: do not add seeds, tasks, or retries, and do not present C1 as an improvement; any successor must preregister a measurement-repair design first.'
    )}</p>
    <ol class="next-steps"><li><span>1</span><div><strong>{nextDecisionNodes[0].title[locale]}</strong><p>{nextDecisionNodes[0].change[locale]}</p></div></li><li><span>2</span><div><strong>{nextDecisionNodes[1].title[locale]}</strong><p>{t('分别报告 acquisition（新学会）、retention（旧能力保留）与 untouched transfer（未见任务迁移）。', 'Report acquisition (new learning), retention (preservation of old capabilities), and untouched transfer (transfer to unseen tasks) separately.')}</p></div></li></ol>
    <p class="handoff-boundary"><strong>H1.42-MV.</strong> {t(
      '校准已收口但 measurement-invalid；未来只有在新 preregistration 下重新建立可靠 measurement chain 和 upstream gates 后，才可另行冻结 fresh T2 panel。',
      'The calibration is closed as measurement-invalid; only a future preregistration that re-establishes a reliable measurement chain and upstream gates may freeze a fresh T2 panel.'
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section secondary" id="methods" aria-labelledby="methods-title">
    <p class="section-number">05</p><h2 id="methods-title">{t('方法与来源', 'Methods and sources')}</h2>
    <details><summary>{t('查看有效性、冻结设计与来源', 'View validity, frozen design, and provenance')}</summary><div class="details-body">
      <dl class="method-list"><div><dt>{t('E2 harvest', 'E2 harvest')}</dt><dd>{t('256 次尝试、132 个合格正例、33 个 qualifying identities；选出 16 条 sealed records。', '256 attempts, 132 qualified positives, 33 qualifying identities; 16 sealed records selected.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('H1.42 calibration', 'H1.42 calibration')}</dt><dd>{t('Stage A: 192 cells / 768 attempts / MV4；Stage B: 144 cells / 576 attempts / MVD0；evaluation total 6.497917 GPU-hours。', 'Stage A: 192 cells / 768 attempts / MV4; Stage B: 144 cells / 576 attempts / MVD0; 6.497917 evaluation GPU-hours total.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('主要终点', 'Primary endpoints')}</dt><dd>{t('acquisition、retention、H1.39 preservation；T2 仅在 upstream gates 通过后另行预注册。', 'Acquisition, retention, and H1.39 preservation; T2 requires a separate preregistration after the upstream gates pass.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('有效性', 'Validity')}</dt><dd>{t('修正 arm / loader_arm validator 混淆后，C1 acquisition 与 preservation 各有一个 parser/runtime-invalid cluster。', 'After fixing the arm / loader_arm validator conflation, C1 retained one parser/runtime-invalid cluster in acquisition and one in preservation.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('快照身份', 'Snapshot identity')}</dt><dd><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code><br/><code>{openEvoProgramSource.campaign}</code></dd></div></dl>
      <p>{t('实时科学状态不由此静态页面决定。请按实际实验 branch → current-campaign.json → 最新 reconciliation/result 解析。', 'This static page does not own live scientific state. Resolve it from the actual experiment branch → current-campaign.json → latest reconciliation/result.')}</p>
      <ul class="source-list"><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.report}>{t('项目总报告', 'Program report')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.ledger}>{t('机器可读账本', 'Machine-readable ledger')}</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.reconciliation}>H1.40 upstream summary</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.h141Reconciliation}>H1.41 reconciliation</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.h142Closeout}>H1.42 closeout</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.h142Reconciliation}>H1.42 reconciliation</a></li><li><a href={openEvoProgramLinks.campaign}>current-campaign.json</a></li></ul>
    </div></details>
    <div class="print-only print-methods">
      <h3>{t('冻结设计与来源', 'Frozen design and provenance')}</h3>
      <dl class="method-list"><div><dt>{t('冻结设计', 'Frozen design')}</dt><dd>{t('H1.40 E2 → 8 sequential G2 increments；不消费 T2。', 'H1.40 E2 → eight sequential G2 increments; no T2 consumption.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('有效性', 'Validity')}</dt><dd>{t('4/4 parser-invalid acquisition cell retained as measurement diagnostic.', '4/4 parser-invalid acquisition cell retained as measurement diagnostic.')}</dd></div><div><dt>{t('快照身份', 'Snapshot identity')}</dt><dd><code>{openEvoProgramSource.branch}@{openEvoProgramSource.commit}</code><br/><code>{openEvoProgramSource.campaign}</code></dd></div></dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-section appendix" id="appendix" aria-labelledby="appendix-title">
    <p class="section-number">06</p><h2 id="appendix-title">{t('附录', 'Appendix')}</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">{t('完整谱系和历史平台记录保留用于审计，默认收起，不参与主结论的视觉排序。', 'The complete lineage and historical-platform record remain available for audit, collapsed by default and outside the visual order of the main conclusion.')}</p>
     <details data-testid="lineage-appendix"><summary>{t(`附录 A：Phase G–H1.41 完整实验谱系（${programTimeline.length} 个节点）`, `Appendix A: complete Phase G–H1.41 lineage (${programTimeline.length} nodes)`)}</summary><ol class="lineage-list">
      {programTimeline.map((item) => <li><details><summary><span class="lineage-coverage">{item.coverage.join(' · ')}</span><strong>{item.title[locale]}</strong><small>{programStageLabels[item.stage][locale]} · {programResultLabels[item.result][locale]}</small></summary><div class="lineage-body"><p>{item.summary[locale]}</p><p><strong>{t('结论边界：', 'Claim boundary: ')}</strong>{item.boundary[locale]}</p><a href={item.evidence}>{t('打开冻结证据', 'Open frozen evidence')}</a></div></details></li>)}
    </ol></details>
    {hasHistoricalAppendix && <details data-testid="rtx6-appendix"><summary>{t('附录 B：RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 历史参数实验', 'Appendix B: historical RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 parametric experiments')}</summary><div class="historical-slot"><slot name="historical" /></div></details>}
    <div class="print-only print-appendices">
       <h3>{t(`附录 A：Phase G–H1.42 完整实验谱系（${programTimeline.length} 个节点）`, `Appendix A: complete Phase G–H1.42 lineage (${programTimeline.length} nodes)`)}</h3>
      <ol class="print-lineage">{programTimeline.map((item) => <li><strong>{item.coverage.join(' · ')} — {item.title[locale]}</strong><p>{item.summary[locale]}</p><p><strong>{t('结论边界：', 'Claim boundary: ')}</strong>{item.boundary[locale]}</p></li>)}</ol>
      {hasHistoricalAppendix && <div class="print-rtx6"><h3>{t('附录 B：RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 历史参数实验', 'Appendix B: historical RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 parametric experiments')}</h3><p>{t('RTX6 是已经退出当前实验主线的历史 4×RTX3090 平台；其记录仅用于方法来源与历史诊断，不改变 H1.38A-C 的主结论。', 'RTX6 is the historical 4×RTX3090 platform that is no longer on the active experiment path; its record supports method provenance and historical diagnosis only and does not change the H1.38A-C primary conclusion.')}</p></div>}
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .paper-report{color:var(--ink);width:min(1040px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(.25rem,2vw,1rem);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.paper-header{max-width:780px;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3rem) 0 2rem;border-top:4px solid var(--accent-deep)}
  .kicker,.section-number{margin:0 0 .65rem;color:var(--accent-deep);font:750 .7rem/1.35 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.paper-header h2,.paper-section h2{margin:0;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.025em}.paper-header h2{font-size:clamp(1.75rem,3.4vw,2.8rem)}.abstract{margin:1.2rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.03rem,1.4vw,1.18rem);line-height:1.78}.abstract strong{font-weight:760}.implication,.section-intro{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.implication{margin:1rem 0 0;padding-left:1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--accent-deep)}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem 1rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.paper-nav a{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:.22em}.paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink)}.paper-section{padding:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.paper-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.7vw,2.25rem)}.section-intro{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem}
  .table-region{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.table-region:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent-deep);outline-offset:3px}.table-region table{width:100%;min-width:800px;border-collapse:collapse}.table-region caption{text-align:left;padding:.85rem 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.table-region th,.table-region td{text-align:left;padding:.78rem .65rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);white-space:nowrap}.table-region thead th{background:var(--surface-muted);color:var(--muted);font-size:.72rem}.table-region tbody th{font-weight:760}.validity-note{max-width:820px;margin:1.2rem 0 2.2rem;padding:.85rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}.validity-note strong{color:var(--ink)}
